      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The former Baharuddin Vocational Institute in Queenstown trained designers and craftsmen in advertising, fashion and printing before moving to Stirling Road in 1969.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
